'''Speed Gale''' or known as '''Gales''', is a stackable [[buff]]. As of [[version 3.13.0]], the buff is granted solely from an '''Invigorating [[Ritual]] Altar''', which buffs both monsters and allies. Each stack grants [[action speed]].
==Invigorating Ritual==
The Invigorating [[Ritual]] has two modifiers:
* {{c|mod|Monsters are fast}}
* {{c|mod|'''Gales''' further accelerate you and monsters}}
